fferent characters and outfit combinations<br>•\tOnline leader boards shows you the “master of the dance floor”<br>•\tIncredibly groovy 70’s disco style soundtrack<br>•\tFunky visuals inspired by 70s fashion and cheesy sci-fi flicks",
